1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,480
I just burst into tears because just the swell of emotion, it was just too much.

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:07,740
And I just cried. I cried happy tears, relief tears.

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:11,860
And then I was like, Oh my gosh, our job is just starting.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,160
And of course, the engineers are celebrating a lot of them.

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,920
You know, they're done. They move on to another project.

6
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,820
They've gotten the rover to Mars.

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,640
And for us, it was like, oh, no, now it gets down to business.

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,280
And so it was like, Okay, we've got a long night ahead of us.

9
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:27,500
There's a tradition at JPL to make working the long,

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,820
hard hours of Mars time a little sweeter.

11
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:32,400
Mission Control has a chest full of ice cream.

12
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,940
So some of Katie's colleagues improvised the pandemic version.

13
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,420
They had ice cream delivered to her front door.

